THD ProScan v12.3 [DOS] - File Processor for 
almost any BBS. Version 12.3 is essentially a
bugfix release to repair the problem with 
wildcard expansion from 12.2. Also fixes the 
RA GIFSPEC description problem. This is a 
full release, including THDEXARC for adding 
Scanner and Archive definitions as well as 
THDTERM for scanning entire directories. OS/2
users can obtain THD212_3.EXE for the native 
OS/2 version of THD ProScan.
